# A game added to the Hall of Fame, as at a game's end (the script host's "open hall_of_fame_new" calls hall_of_fame(1)): the
# loaded game is rated and put in its faction's list, takes the records it beats and has a picture of the screen kept with
# it. Closed with Escape, and the list shown again (it is written to the fame file and read back). Then two more of the
# same game, each at the top place, move the lower ones down (and their pictures with them). State: the list and the window object's fields (see hall_of_fame.scene).
25 load
42 state fame 0x9a3840 0x1324
42 state work 0x74e50c 0x3c
42 state sel 0x758410 4
42 state group 0x7534e8 0x10
42 state rects 0x758f24 0x60
42 state btn0 0x753fb4 4
42 state btn1 0x754b00 4
42 state btn2 0x75564c 4
42 state btn3 0x756198 4
42 state btn4 0x756ce4 4
42 state btn5 0x757830 4
44 open hall_of_fame_new
50 snap added
52 click 280 380
56 snap added-place
58 click 680 160
62 snap added-record
64 key Escape
68 snap closed
70 open hall_of_fame
76 snap reread
78 key Escape
82 snap closed-again
84 open hall_of_fame_new
90 snap added-second
92 click 280 440
96 snap second-place
98 key Escape
102 open hall_of_fame_new
108 snap added-third
110 click 280 500
114 snap third-place
116 click 192 258
120 snap third-faction
122 key Escape
126 snap closed-end
130 close
